  "notes": "Bay-born, LA-facing club rap built on recognisable flips. Two parameters carry it: **major at roughly 65%, the brightest tonal profile on the female-rap side of this lane**, and a melodic layer that is a *re-voiced quotation* rather than an original motif — her records interpolate 90s and 2000s hits, so the progressions are pop cycles (`I–V–vi–IV`, `I–vi`) rather than minor vamps. A hard open hat on the \"and-of-4\" is the Bay inflection on an otherwise ratchet kit.",
